&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mid-Market Business Development Director — Brave Search API&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote - US Based - East Coast and West Coast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote | Full-Time | Mid-Market and SMB Sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brave is on a mission to fix the web by giving users a safer, faster, and more private browsing experience. Already serving over 120 million monthly active users, Brave is also building the next generation of privacy-respecting, independent search technology —&lt;a href=&quot;https://search.brave.com/&quot;&gt; Brave Search&lt;/a&gt; — from the ground up.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now expanding nationally and internationally and seeking a highly driven, experienced, and entrepreneurial Mid-Level&amp;nbsp; Business Development Manager to drive outbound sales efforts, execute deals, for the Brave Search API, targeting small and mid-sized AI companies, LLM providers, and search-integrated platforms in the USA. This is a high-impact, revenue-focused role for someone with deep outbound sales experience and the hunger to build from the ground up in a fast-moving, startup-like environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the outbound sales strategy for the Brave Search API, focusing on making deals and building relationships deals with mid-size and start up AI and search-integrated companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pipeline growth through aggressive outbound prospecting, cold outreach, and tailored pitch development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, contact, and engage decision-makers at mid-size and small companies; effectively communicate the value of Brave Search’s independence, privacy, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle — from lead generation to signed contracts — with support from product and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling demos and presentations that resonate with technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (product, engineering, marketing, legal) to ensure seamless deal execution and post-sale integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to internal teams based on customer needs, market trends, and competitive insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet or exceed ambitious sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a strong entrepreneurial mindset and the ability to thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced, and sometimes ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in mid-size B2B sales or small business development, with a proven track record in outbound sales and closing complex API, SaaS, or data partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to AI, search, data, or developer-focused companies is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with technical sales — able to confidently pitch APIs and data infrastructure to product and engineering stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills — persuasive, confident, and concise in writing and speaking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with CRM tools and modern sales engagement platforms (e.g., HubSpot, Outreach, Apollo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong belief in Brave’s mission and values, including user privacy and internet decentralization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in and selling to early-stage or high-growth startup environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background or deep interest in search technology, LLMs, or AI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical or analytical background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Brave browser and Brave Search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Join Brave?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first team with people from around the globe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and equity package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission-driven culture with a focus on user privacy and web innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to help redefine how search works in the age of AI — with one of the only fully independent search indexes on the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation: &amp;nbsp; $100,000 to $125,000.00 USD in salary X2 OTE&lt;/p&gt;
